        <font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> Mass PvP is where it's going to be at soon.  </P><P>Generally speaking, as it is now your only "rogue stoppers" are Protection spec warriors and to a lesser extent beast spec hunters.</P><P>If these changes go live hunters will be able to reveal rogues, but no do crap to them.</P><P>Now, rogues have a harder time locking mages and shadow priests.</P><P>If you want *IMHO* the most dominating battlefield PvP class/builds go Shadow Priest or Ice Mage.    The ONLY reason I beat them 40% of the time is that I bluff them out. 10% of the time I simply outsmart them, the rest of the time I'm laying a freezing trap and hauling ass the other way.</P><P>Mages with manashield, blink hard hitting nukes are just damn near unstoppable.  To me they are the premier PvP class.</P><P>Shadow priests with fear, snares, massive dots, health drains and PWS are a force to be reckoned with as well.</P><P>Rogues are awesome as long as they can kill their target and recloak unseen.  If  they get spotted by a druid doing so....dead.   Hunter?  Dead.  Warrior? SOOO dead.</P><P>Warriors in any form are gimped in PvP.   Freeze trap...immobilized warrior long enough for reinforcements.   Got a druid?  You now have a warrior that's standing there with drool coming out of his lip.   Mages snare the crap out of a war, blink, take off 1400hps, repete.  </P><P>Their only redeeming factor is with a well coodinated support group they are awesome because people frequently DO ignore them on the field they have the ability to dominate.</P><P></P><P><font size=1><font color=red>(Retired)EverQuest:</font id=red> <b>Kaashar Do'Van</b> 65 Necromancer<font color=red>/</font id=red><b>Kanr Do'Van</b> 65 Cleric<font color=red>/</font id=red><b>Kamaria</b> 65 Druid<font color=red>/</font id=red><b>Kilnoar Do'Van</b> 56 Shadow Knight<BR><font color=red>(RIP E&B)Earth and Beyond:</font id=red><b>Kaashar</b> 150 Terran Trader<font color=red>/</font id=red><b>Kilnoar </b>150 Jenquai Explorer<font color=red>/</font id=red><b>Doshan </b>150 Jenquai Warrior<BR>(Retired)<BR><font color=red>Shadowbane:</font id=red> <b>Kaashar Do'Van</b> 52 Druid<font color=red>/</font id=red><b>-Shaft-</b> 53 Confessor<font color=red>/</font id=red><b>Vaashar</b> 32 Druid<BR><font color=red>(Retired)DAOC:</font id=red><b>Kaashar Do'Van</b> 50 Necromancer<font color=red>/</font id=red><b>Kamaria</b> 48 Druid<BR><font color=red>(Retired)Priston Tale:</font id=red><b>Doshan</b> 40 Wizard<font color=red>/</font id=red><b>PoleCat</b> 35 Pikeman<BR><font color=red>(Retired)Star Wars Galaxies:</font id=red><b>Kaashar  Do'Van</b> Master Creature Handler,Pistoleer,Rifleman,Combat Medic<font color=red>/</font id=red><b>Kilnoar</b> Master Pistoleer,Doctor and Musician<BR><font color=red>(Retired)Anarchy Online:</font id=red><b>Kaashar</b> 191 Nanomage Meta Physicist<font color=red>/</font id=red><b>Flnx</b> 165 Atrox Enforcer<BR><font color=red>World of Warcraft:</font id=red><b>Kanr</b> 60 Druid<font color=red>/</font id=red><b>Lomandar</b> 60 Hunter</font id=size1><a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
