        <font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> I'm not that great at min/maxxing, but I *love* the sheer utility of a warrior with engineering.  I've got so many little tricks to pull out for any particular situation that the biggest disadvantage is just managing them all efficiently.  Even as I am now at lowly lvl 42 I make a great support character in PvP to the higher-ups with the wide range of effects I can produce.</P><P>Even when I hit 60 I may not be pound for pound the best brawler, but I've no doubt that a *well played* warrior will be huge advantage to any PvP team.</P><P>- Hally Halgernon, Office Gnome.<a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
